### Category Catalog API Requests
# Use this file to test the category endpoints in IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code REST Client.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@categoryId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### 0. Login as Seeded Admin User (200 OK)
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 1. Login as Seeded Catalog User (200 OK)
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "catalog",
  "password": "catalog1234"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("catalogAccessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Create Category (201 Created)
# Only ADMIN users can create categories.
POST {{host}}/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{categoryId}}",
  "name": "Keyboards",
  "description": "Mechanical and ergonomic keyboards"
}

### 3. List Categories with Optional Filters (200 OK)
# CUSTOMER and CATALOG users can list categories.
GET {{host}}/v1/categories?name=key&description=mechanical
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Category - Forbidden for Non-Admin User (403 Forbidden)
POST {{host}}/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444445",
  "name": "Accessories",
  "description": "Desktop accessories"
}

### 5. Create Category - Conflict Error (409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{categoryId}}",
  "name": "Duplicate Category",
  "description": "Attempt to create a category with an existing identifier"
}

### 6. Delete Category (204 No Content)
# Delete returns 409 Conflict if any product references the category.
DELETE {{host}}/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 7. Delete Non-Existent Category (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{host}}/v1/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

